  "description": "Central City Library (branch code\u202fCCL\u201101, ISIC\u202f8510) is situated at 123\u202fMain\u202fSt, Metropolis, NY\u202f10101, United States. You can reach the library by phone at\u202f+1\u2011555\u2011123\u20114567 or by fax at\u202f+1\u2011555\u2011765\u20114321, and its website is https://centralcitylibrary.example.com. A map of the location is available at https://maps.example.com/?q=Central+City+Library, and the library\u2019s Global Location Number is\u202f1234567890123. The library\u2019s logo can be seen at https://centralcitylibrary.example.com/logo.png, and a representative photograph (captioned \u201cFront view of the library\u201d) is hosted at https://centralcitylibrary.example.com/photo1.jpg. It is part of the Metropolis Public Buildings complex and includes a dedicated Children\u2019s Reading Room within its premises.\n\nThe library holds an aggregate rating of\u202f4.7 based on\u202f128\u202freviews. One recent review by Jane\u202fDoe, dated\u202f2023\u201108\u201115, gave a perfect\u202f5\u2011star rating and praised the \u201cExcellent collection and helpful staff.\u201d Regular opening hours are Monday through Friday, 09:00\u202fto\u202f18:00, with a special Saturday schedule of 10:00\u202fto\u202f16:00. Smoking is not permitted on the premises. Additional features include Wi\u2011Fi availability (true) and wheelchair accessibility (true) as listed under amenity features and property values."
